- GXzwq6waYb (Semantic Clustering for Hallucination Detection): Scores 3, 3, 3, 8 → Withdrawn/Reject
- N4mb3MBV6J (Improving UQ via Semantic Embeddings): Scores 6, 5, 6 → Reject
- Zj12nzlQbz (INSIDE/EigenScore): Scores 8, 6, 6, 6 → Accept (poster)
- 0pbxX2jatP (Measuring Free-Form Inconsistency via BERTScore): Scores 5, 3, 5 → Reject
- EwRxk3Ho1V (Beyond Cosine Similarity / USMB): Scores 3, 6, 3, 5 → Reject

