- `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/XWaI6FLVgi.md` (Diversifying Spurious Subgraphs for OOD) — shared concerns about rationale/spurious identification validity and hyperparameter selection
- `/home/wg25r/review_agent/human_reviews/u8zA1a2Vhf.md` (Combine and Compare: Graph Rationale Learning) — shared concerns about limited task scope and heuristic-based methods lacking theoretical guarantees
