### Strengths

1. **Novel and well-motivated architecture**: HyperDAS addresses a real bottleneck in mechanistic interpretability—the brute-force search over layers and token positions—by using a hypernetwork to automate localization. The two-stage design (token-position selection + subspace identification) is intuitive and the Householder transformation for orthogonal subspace generation is elegant.

